# FlowCollector -- the whole control-room shutdown-to-startup chain, three shifts.
# Every tick line is a CHANGE. A tick whose diff is empty emits nothing. ASSIST marks a
# value this instrument wrote into its own private engine; no other line is anything but
# the engine's own arithmetic. GATE/SET/DELT is the command table taken exhaustively.
# Ticks were stepped at full speed, one tick = one Engine:Step(Config.Sim.Step) = 1s.
# rng: Lehmer, seed 20260926. Keys tracked: 73.
# config: Config.Device.CBLPressurePerLevel=0.6000 Config.Device.CBLPurgeCooldown=4 Config.Device.CBLPurgeStressRelief=25 Config.Device.CBLStressGain=0.4000 Config.Device.CBLStressThreshold=75 Config.Device.HDEFDecay=0.0250 Config.Device.HDEFHeatGain=1 Config.Device.HDEFHeatLoss=2 Config.Device.HDEFMaxIntegrity=12 Config.Device.HDEFRecovery=0.2000 Config.Device.MASSOutputCostPerLevel=0.0250 Config.Device.MASSReductionPerLevel=0.2000 Config.Device.PumpWearPerLevel=0.0600 Config.Device.RadiationPerState=120 Config.Device.RepairPerSecond=10 Config.Device.RepairRange=20 Config.Device.SAMRadiationLimit=600 Config.Device.SAMTargetHigh=14000 Config.Device.SAMTargetLow=7000 Config.Events.EquinoxMultiplier=3 Config.Events.EquinoxSeconds=720 Config.Events.EquinoxWearMultiplier=2 Config.Grav.ChargeSeconds=6 Config.Grav.FailureDamage=80 Config.Grav.MisfireDamage=25 Config.Grav.SuccessDamage=5 Config.Grav.WindowSeconds=1.5000 Config.Interaction.Cooldown=0.1500 Config.Interaction.MaximumDistance=6 Config.Shift.BootSeconds=3 Config.Shift.Quotas.1=512 Config.Shift.Quotas.2=1024 Config.Shift.Quotas.3=3072 Config.Shift.ShutdownLimit=17000 Config.Shift.ShutdownSeconds=5 Config.Shift.StartupSeconds=8 Config.Sim.Ambient=20 Config.Sim.CBLHeat=65 Config.Sim.ExtractionFraction=0.2500 Config.Sim.FanPressure=70 Config.Sim.HighPressure=13500 Config.Sim.HighPressureDivisor=100 Config.Sim.MaxCatchupSteps=10 Config.Sim.MeltdownTemperature=39000 Config.Sim.NoiseMax=49 Config.Sim.NoiseMin=-50 Config.Sim.OutputDivisors.1=250 Config.Sim.OutputDivisors.2=160 Config.Sim.OutputDivisors.3=120 Config.Sim.OutputDivisors.4=45 Config.Sim.OutputOffsets.1=50 Config.Sim.OutputOffsets.2=100 Config.Sim.OutputOffsets.3=250 Config.Sim.OutputOffsets.4=400 Config.Sim.PressureDivisor=50 Config.Sim.PumpCooling=120 Config.Sim.QuotaDivisor=60 Config.Sim.ReferenceTick=2.5000 Config.Sim.StallCooling=750 Config.Sim.StallPressure=2200 Config.Sim.StallTemperature=2000 Config.Sim.StartupPressure=5000 Config.Sim.StartupTempera